# External embedding

Sources: `packages/web/src/shared/lib/embed.lib.ts` and `packages/web/src/shared/lib/embed-frame.ui.tsx`.

- Use the existing allowlist validator and `EmbedFrame` rather than a new raw iframe path. Import the concrete modules.
- An allowlisted origin is a trust decision; do not weaken the allowlist merely to make a preview render.
- Choose the minimum sandbox capabilities required. Preserve URL protocol checks and referrer policy.
- Keep the configured CSP frame policy consistent with application allowlisting; an iframe rendering successfully is not proof its contents are isolated safely.
- Display an explicit blocked/failed state rather than silently redirecting to an unvalidated origin.
